        }
      ],
      "impact": "The Ethernet/PI status LEDs D4, D14, and D23 are expected to remain dark because their common anode power net is floating and cannot provide the required forward bias.",
      "confidence": 0.78
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files support an anomaly: the LED common-anode power net /LED_3.3V_POWER_SW is floating and connected only to D4, D14, and D23, so those status LEDs lack a supply and would not behave as intended."
}

